   "text": "the four pushes down add up to the one push up: 0.1076 + 0.0384 + 0.0464 + 0.7404 = 1 - 0.0673",
   "originalText": "the four pushes down add up to the one push up: 0.1076 + 0.0384 + 0.0464 + 0.7404 = 1 - 0.0673",
